{% include "pagehead.njk" %}
<section class="wrap two-col two-col-top">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2 class="h-section">Who Partners with Abundance Foundation?</h2>
    <p>Our Partners span across the globe and include philanthropists, entrepreneurs, leaders in academia and the nonprofit sector, as well as innovative and visionary foundations and corporations.</p>
    <p>Together, we are able to utilize innovative methods and empower local leaders in communities worldwide to develop new capacities that address pressing social problems and build lasting improvements in quality of life.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="callout-box">
    <h2>Partner with Us</h2>
    <p>We work with each of our partners to identify unique and valuable ways to collaborate. If you would like to explore opportunities to get involved with Abundance Foundation, please contact <a href="mailto:partner@abundance.org">partner@abundance.org</a>.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:partner@abundance.org">Email partner@abundance.org</a>
  </div>
</section>
